    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a compact roguelike\u00a0inspired by <strong>Seraphs Last Stand,</strong> built around fast 30-minute runs, game-breaking builds, and glorious chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.poster.avif?t=1750351007\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.webm?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.mp4?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Characters</strong>: Choose from 5 characters each with unique base abilities to change the pace of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.poster.avif?t=1750351007\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.webm?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.mp4?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.poster.avif?t=1750351007\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.webm?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.mp4?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2014no grinding required\u2014creating a hop-in, hop-out experience for players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a compact roguelike\u00a0inspired by <strong>Seraphs Last Stand,</strong> built around fast 30-minute runs, game-breaking builds, and glorious chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.poster.avif?t=1750351007\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.webm?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.mp4?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Characters</strong>: Choose from 5 characters each with unique base abilities to change the pace of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.poster.avif?t=1750351007\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.webm?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.mp4?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.poster.avif?t=1750351007\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.webm?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.mp4?t=1750351007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2014no grinding required\u2014creating a hop-in, hop-out experience for players.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a Bonfire Spirit, unleashing flaming bullets to fend off relentless waves of shadowy foes. Master dynamic movement, evolve your powers, and adapt to the ever-shifting chaos. Keep your flame burning in this fast-paced, stylized 2D action-roguelike, where every moment is a fight for survival!",
